  "limits": [
    "Private complete profile preparation only; no runtime creation, public assets or save changes.",
    "Compiled bind zero, local true, particle-local false, omitted blend zero and other defaults are explicit reconstruction policies, not authored values. Raw presences and complete source remain separately retained.",
    "Blend 3 is the pinned reader none mode and requires unblended/alpha-tested rendering; do not pass it through an additive renderer. Native GPU shader/sampler/CPU parity remains uncalibrated.",
    "Field label hashes match candidates; stepped 60 Hz force order, spatial drag falloff, target attachment and source frame integration require an explicit local adapter and acceptance tests.",
    "Fluid has random-start and a 2x2 grid but omits numFrames; compiled one-frame default is not a proven native frame-count recovery. Blood declares startFrame 15, 16 frames, 4x4 grid and raw frame-rate 1.",
    "Censor modulation and importance values are retained without inventing global censorship switches or quality filtering. All eleven emitter profiles remain present.",
    "Critical ground_glow stays an arbitrary quad at the declared target attachment; its name does not authorize terrain projection.",
    "The 75-tick retention is a conservative local first-update bound including the float32 1.2000000476837158 life multiplier. Source linger does not extend finite visible life."
  ],
